      "text": "Subject: Drawing, Speech Competitions and \"Meri Seva, Mera Sankalp\" – Student Reel\nMaking Competition under \"Sewa Sankalp Abhiyan\" from 17.09.2026 to 17.10.2026 in\nGovernment Schools of NCT of Delhi."
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 5,
      "poly": [
        91.63,
