        500.99,
        255.13,
        500.99,
        339.33,
        91.63,
        339.33
      ],
      "text": "The Directorate of Education, Government of NCT of Delhi, is pleased to announce the\norganisation of various student-centric activities under \"Sewa Sankalp Abhiyan\", with the\nobjective of providing students an opportunity to express their ideas, creativity and aspirations\nrelating to public service, development, nation-building and the vision of \"Viksit Bharat\n@2047\". The Abhiyan seeks to highlight the journey of public service over the past 25 years\nand create awareness among students regarding various welfare and development initiatives."
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 6,
      "poly": [
        92.22,
        349.43,
        500.39,
        349.43,
        500.39,
        377.22,
        92.22,
        377.22
      ],
      "text": "Accordingly, all Heads of Government Schools of NCT of Delhi are directed to ensure active\nparticipation of students in the following competitions:"
